  "geometryPolicy": "Preserve the full individual275.6x164.5m palace/Armeria plan. Main roof excludes the Prince court andthree service lightwells. Main ground arcades are real deep galleries;their upper order is closed arched glazing,with the attic behind the upper terrace. Lower forecourt arcade bands remain open before closed range back walls. South gateway stays open between its actual mapped piers. All custom columns/urns/clock panels are original abstractions,no copied sculpture or lettering.",
