  "limitations": "Four ordinary aerial/facade/court pictures plusstandard PMTiles/global terrain only. Fine column/window/urn/statue inventories,roof junctions andsmall service-court details are original approximations. Optical room interiors excluded;closed glazing/doors terminate galleries. No private/embedded images,no bespoke survey/archive sourcing. Adjacent cathedral/museum andgardens excluded. Physical laptop/phone/dense-city timings unmeasured.",
